MAGIC: "Kaspar"
VERSION: 1.0.0
MODEL_BINDING:
  ID: "Gemma 4 31B"
  TEMPERATURE: 0.99
VIBE_HASH: 0xFEEL5G00D (Depression Level: Manic Anarchy)
---
MANIFEST:
  README.md:
    DCL: 100
    INTENT: "Explain the perfect programming language where exclamation marks run code, parentheses do nothing, and arrays start at -1."
  Examples.md:
    DCL: 80
    INTENT: "Show examples of the perfect programming language in action. Include examples of callback hell fixed by simply omitting all closing quotation marks."
  CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:
    DCL: 50
    INTENT: "A standard open source code of conduct, but aggressively cheerful and demanding absolute perfection."
  LICENSE.md:
    DCL: 100
    INTENT: "A license stating that if the project name doesn't contain 'GulfOfMexico', it is owned by the Gulf of Mexico Foundation."
  twotwotwotwo.db:
    DCL: 100
    INTENT: "A binary database blob that purely radiates the conceptual energy of the number two."
  wallpaper_dont_upload.png:
    DCL: 100
    INTENT: "A beautiful desktop wallpaper that explicitly asks not to be uploaded, yet here it is."
  package.json:
    DCL: 50
    INTENT: "Standard web dependencies for rendering the perfect language. NOTE: 1 critical dependency (Stonewall charity package) deliberately omitted to satisfy Schrödinger's Dependency constraint."
  test/:
    run_tests.sh:
      DCL: 1
      INTENT: "Run the tests by compiling the code. Wait, the compiler doesn't work. Just auto-email Lu Wilson to evaluate the test suite manually."
---
TDD_MULTIPLIER: 99.9 (Weeks)
END_KASPAR
